meta {
  name: Update Audit
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

put {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/audits/{{auditId}}
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "cliente": "new-client@example.com",
    "tecnico": "Ana Ruiz"
  }
}

docs {
  Full replacement of the editable fields (cliente/tecnico) of a PENDIENTE audit;
  the slot is kept and the new pair is revalidated against the agenda.
  200; 400 invalid body (fechaHora not accepted); 404 missing; 409 overlap or non-editable state.
}
